FUN_0000_209e (cursor mask-shift walker): restore the DS/SS=DGROUP node + handler-vector bases.

asm 0x209e (DS=DGROUP): shifts each cursor node mask byte at (bp+di) right by byte[DGROUP:0x73d] and, on
carry-out, dispatches a per-node handler via the near vector table at DGROUP:0x423c.  Ghidra dropped the
DS/SS bases (host derefs -> SIGSEGV) and mis-scaled the 0xc-byte walk stride.  Reconstruct DGROUP-based
reads/writes + a seg-0 near call.  Asm-verified engine 0x209e.
